<title>SINGAPORE: Bukit Sembawang full year profit surges.</title>
<headline>Bukit Sembawang full year profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     33.11   vs   14.68</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)	 35.00   vs   35.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)   137.95   vs   61.17</p>
<p>    Turnover		 69.73   vs   29.02</p>
<p>    Other income	    0.38   vs    0.50</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 44.69   vs   19.28</p>
<p>    Tax			11.58   vs    4.60</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain    0.02   vs    0.20</p>
<p>Dividend pay/ register - Sept 16 1997/ Sept 1 1997  </p>
<p>Note - Full name Bukit Sembawang Estates Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newssroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
